  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>To find the point where curve intersects&nbsp;the y-axis&nbsp;<br /><br />Put,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, the&nbsp;point is (0, 1).<br /><br />On differentiating<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Put,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Slope of normal <math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Equation of normal at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfy the normal.</p>",
